{"id":"huntik:page:2003","page_id":2003,"title":"Boltflare","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Boltflare is a basic spell that creates a sphere of bright orange energy which can be used both as a candlelight or as an offensive magical blast. For many Seekers, it is one of the first powers they learn.\n\nAn extremely versatile spell, Boltflare is extremely hot, enough to melt a brass doorknob, [S1E16] and can float around on its own above the caster, acting as a source of light in dark locations. [S1E04]","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S1E24_Lok_Boltflare.jpg","wikitext":"File:S1E24_Lok_Boltflare.jpg","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Orange","wikitext":"Orange","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Offensive / Utility","wikitext":"Offensive / Utility","links":[]},"first":{"text":"\"The Casterwill Client\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Casterwill Client]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Casterwill Client","label":"The Casterwill Client","target_id":"huntik:page:2512","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Casterwill_Client","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2512"}]},"nlname":{"text":"Gloeiflits","wikitext":"Gloeiflits","links":[]},"frname":{"text":"Flash Éclair","wikitext":"Flash Éclair","links":[]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S1E24_Lok_Boltflare.jpg","value_text":"File:S1E24_Lok_Boltflare.jpg","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Orange","value_text":"Orange","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Offensive / Utility","value_text":"Offensive / Utility","links":[]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Casterwill Client]]\"","value_text":"\"The Casterwill Client\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Casterwill Client","label":"The Casterwill Client","target_id":"huntik:page:2512","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Casterwill_Client","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2512"}]},{"name":"nlname","value_wikitext":"Gloeiflits","value_text":"Gloeiflits","links":[]},{"name":"frname","value_wikitext":"Flash Éclair","value_text":"Flash Éclair","links":[]}],"start":0,"end":188}],"sections":[{"heading":"Users","level":2,"wikitext":"* [[Dante Vale]]\n* [[DeFoe]]\n* [[Den Fears]]\n* [[Lok Lambert]]\n* [[Sophie Casterwill]]\n* [[Suits]]\n* [[Wind]] {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}\n* [[Zhalia Moon]]","text":"• Dante Vale\n• DeFoe\n• Den Fears\n• Lok Lambert\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Suits\n• Wind [The Phoenix's Ashes]\n• Zhalia Moon"},{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"Despite Boltflare's being a basic spell, [[Lok Lambert]] took an abnormally long time to be able to properly cast it. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\n[[Lok Lambert]] used Boltflare to heat up [[Complaining customer|a customer's]] coffee, however the spell made it too hot and caused both himself and [[Sophie Casterwill]] to be fired from that job. {{source|All Work and No Pay}}\n\nBoltflare was used to melt the metal doorknob to [[Klaus' bookshop]]. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}\n\n{{clear}}","text":"Despite Boltflare's being a basic spell, Lok Lambert took an abnormally long time to be able to properly cast it. [The Casterwill Client]\n\nLok Lambert used Boltflare to heat up a customer's coffee, however the spell made it too hot and caused both himself and Sophie Casterwill to be fired from that job. [All Work and No Pay]\n\nBoltflare was used to melt the metal doorknob to Klaus' bookshop. [The Bookshop Hunter]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Flash-éclair\n|DUT=Gloeiflits\n|POR=Labareda, Raio de Luz, Raio de Fogo}}\n\n[[nl:Gloeiflits]]\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Utility spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]","text":"French: Flash-éclair\nDutch: Gloeiflits\nPortuguese: Labareda, Raio de Luz, Raio de Fogo\n\nnl:Gloeiflits"}],"full_text":"Boltflare is a basic spell that creates a sphere of bright orange energy which can be used both as a candlelight or as an offensive magical blast. For many Seekers, it is one of the first powers they learn.\n\nAn extremely versatile spell, Boltflare is extremely hot, enough to melt a brass doorknob, [S1E16] and can float around on its own above the caster, acting as a source of light in dark locations. [S1E04]\n\nUsers\n\n• Dante Vale\n• DeFoe\n• Den Fears\n• Lok Lambert\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Suits\n• Wind [The Phoenix's Ashes]\n• Zhalia Moon\n\nHistory\n\nDespite Boltflare's being a basic spell, Lok Lambert took an abnormally long time to be able to properly cast it. [The Casterwill Client]\n\nLok Lambert used Boltflare to heat up a customer's coffee, however the spell made it too hot and caused both himself and Sophie Casterwill to be fired from that job. [All Work and No Pay]\n\nBoltflare was used to melt the metal doorknob to Klaus' bookshop. [The Bookshop Hunter]\n\nInternational Names\n\nFrench: Flash-éclair\nDutch: Gloeiflits\nPortuguese: Labareda, Raio de Luz, Raio de Fogo\n\nnl:Gloeiflits","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E24_Lok_Boltflare.jpg\n| aura  = Orange\n| class = Offensive / Utility\n| first = \"[[The Casterwill Client]]\"\n| nlname = Gloeiflits\n| frname = Flash Éclair\n}}'''Boltflare''' is a basic spell that creates a sphere of bright orange energy which can be used both as a candlelight or as an offensive magical blast. For many [[Seekers]], it is one of the first powers they learn. \n\nAn extremely versatile spell, Boltflare is extremely hot, enough to melt a brass doorknob, {{Source|S1E16}} and can float around on its own above the caster, acting as a source of light in dark locations.  {{Source|S1E04}}\n\n== Users ==\n* [[Dante Vale]]\n* [[DeFoe]]\n* [[Den Fears]]\n* [[Lok Lambert]]\n* [[Sophie Casterwill]]\n* [[Suits]]\n* [[Wind]] {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}\n* [[Zhalia Moon]]\n\n== History ==\nDespite Boltflare's being a basic spell, [[Lok Lambert]] took an abnormally long time to be able to properly cast it. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\n[[Lok Lambert]] used Boltflare to heat up [[Complaining customer|a customer's]] coffee, however the spell made it too hot and caused both himself and [[Sophie Casterwill]] to be fired from that job. {{source|All Work and No Pay}}\n\nBoltflare was used to melt the metal doorknob to [[Klaus' bookshop]]. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}\n\n{{clear}}\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Flash-éclair\n|DUT=Gloeiflits\n|POR=Labareda, Raio de Luz, Raio de Fogo}}\n\n[[nl:Gloeiflits]]\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Utility spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Offensive spells","Orange-aura spells","Organization magic","Utility spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:2512","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Casterwill Client","label":"The Casterwill Client","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Casterwill_Client","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2512"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1997","status":"resolved","target_title":"Seekers","label":"Seekers","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Seekers","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1997"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2048","status":"resolved","target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4303","status":"resolved","target_title":"Den Fears","label":"Den Fears","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Den_Fears","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4303"},{"target_id":"huntik